English documentation for this project. Replace this introduction with a
project overview, then add Markdown pages under `docs/`.

## Development

```bash
uv sync --locked --only-group docs
uv run --no-sync zensical serve --dev-addr 127.0.0.1:8000
```

## Build and check

```bash
uv run --no-sync zensical build --strict
uv run --no-sync python scripts/check-docs-site.py
```

The build produces HTML, a searchable site, Markdown exports, `llms.txt`, and
`llms-full.txt`. Building does not publish the site.
